<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Watkins posts A$0.84 mln year profit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Watkins posts A$0.84 mln year profit.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    2.11  vs   5.18 loss</p>
<p>    Net				     0.84  vs  14.16 loss</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	    nil   vs   nil</p>
<p>    Sales				 134.90  vs 206.03</p>
<p>    Other income			  1.80  vs   2.03</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   2.1   vs   6.0 loss</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			nil   vs   0.27 loss</p>
<p>    Tax				     0.77  vs   1.74 credit</p>
<p>    Interest				0.69  vs   1.77</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  0.82  vs   1.67</p>
<p>NOTE: Watkins Pacific Ltd is a property developer and manager and has operations in commercial printing and food packaging distribution.  </p>
<p>Watkins Pacific reported an extraodinary loss after tax of A$495,000 in 1995/96 to provide for losses from sale of U.S. businesses after reporting a A$10.45 million extraordinary loss after tax in 1994/95. -- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
